### Data Wrangling

The dataset required some minor wrangling:

- Removing tracks with missing `popularity`
- Creating `duration_min` as `duration_ms / 60000`
- Removing duplicates if any
- Removing tracks with duration more than 15 minutes (podcasts)

These preprocessing steps ensured that the final dataset focuses on typical music tracks suitable for examining the relationship between audio features and track popularity.

```{r, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE, results="hide"}
spotify_df <- spotify_df %>%
  filter(!is.na(popularity)) %>%
  mutate(duration_min = duration_ms / 60000) %>%
  distinct()

summary(spotify_df)

```

```{r, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE, results="hide"}
# Remove tracks longer than 15 minutes (podcasts)
spotify_df <- spotify_df %>%
  filter(duration_min <= 15)

summary(spotify_df$duration_min)
```



